              "text": "32:28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Israel:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ompö Eprania kelentöy, “Kinoghyot nko Tororöt,” anta kïmwa lö, “Porsot Tororöt.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ompöwölo keporyenyi nko Tororöt nko pich airïntonenyi.”",
          "type": "text",
