              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïtep Yakopo chichay lö, “Kaykay osoghinyi lö mwowante kaynengu.” Wölo kïlenchï, “Ompö ne tetepanyi kaynenyan?” Kuperur nyinte Yakopo ompö atoni.",
